    <item>
      <title>Welcome to ExoClient!</title>
      <link>https://github.com/gabrielmartindev/exoclient-files</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>ExoClient Team</dc:creator>
      <slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
        <p>ExoClient is here: a clean, fast client for Minecraft 1.8.9 PvP.</p>
        <p><strong>What's inside:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>A sharp, modern main menu</li>
          <li>HUD mods: FPS, CPS, keystrokes and armor status</li>
          <li>The ExoClient cape</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Thanks for playing. More updates are on the way!</p>
      ]]></content:encoded>
